WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:46.680 --> 01:47.800
Qingcang.

01:49.520 --> 01:52.080
You've always used me as a tool
to revive the Moon Tribe!

01:52.880 --> 01:55.240
You made me suffer
the loss of my emotions!

01:55.920 --> 01:58.440
You made me bear the name
of killing my own father!

01:58.520 --> 02:01.640
You made me a monster
that everyone avoids!

02:02.440 --> 02:04.640
Have you ever felt heartbroken for me?

02:04.720 --> 02:06.760
Have you ever found it unbearable
to see me suffer?

02:11.160 --> 02:12.040
Qingcang.

02:15.360 --> 02:17.560
You were young, strong,

02:18.600 --> 02:20.040
and talented.

02:23.600 --> 02:25.240
I believed

02:26.000 --> 02:28.360
you could master the Hellfire.

02:29.200 --> 02:30.200
You

02:31.160 --> 02:32.760
were the hope

02:33.400 --> 02:35.640
of the survival of the Moon Tribe.

02:38.440 --> 02:39.800
This again.

02:41.600 --> 02:43.320
I'm sick of it.

02:45.040 --> 02:46.320
Let me ask you now.

02:47.520 --> 02:49.400
If you could turn back time,

02:50.280 --> 02:52.120
would you make a different choice?

03:00.120 --> 03:01.360
Say something!

03:06.720 --> 03:08.560
If I could turn back time,

03:10.240 --> 03:12.880
I would make the same decision.

03:17.200 --> 03:18.400
I knew it.

03:20.520 --> 03:21.920
No matter what,

03:22.920 --> 03:25.120
it's my duty to revive the Moon Tribe.

03:27.000 --> 03:28.080
But you are

03:30.000 --> 03:32.640
a father who is worse than a beast.

03:33.680 --> 03:35.960
That's why you have a son
who is worse than a beast.

03:36.040 --> 03:37.040
My son.

03:40.400 --> 03:41.800
At that time,

03:44.640 --> 03:46.000
I had no choice.

03:48.160 --> 03:49.480
I really had no choice.

03:49.560 --> 03:51.760
You don't have to look so hypocritical!

03:52.720 --> 03:54.840
Aren't you always
fierce, strict, and firm?

03:55.880 --> 03:58.080
Why are you saying this now?

04:11.800 --> 04:12.640
My lord,

04:13.240 --> 04:15.920
Lady Chidi led the immortal army
and attacked us.

04:16.000 --> 04:18.519
We lost the south of Silver Lake.

04:19.120 --> 04:21.160
My lord, the north has fallen.

04:21.240 --> 04:24.080
Eight thousand soldiers were wiped out.

04:31.040 --> 04:32.120
Father,

04:32.640 --> 04:35.080
you promised that you'd play Cuju with me.

04:38.720 --> 04:39.680
After all,

04:40.600 --> 04:43.280
you still treated me
like a sharp blade without emotions.

04:44.680 --> 04:47.080
You used me as a tool
to resist the Fairy Realm.

04:49.440 --> 04:50.960
I couldn't bear to see you suffer.

04:51.480 --> 04:53.080
How dare you say that!

04:53.160 --> 04:55.440
You couldn't bear it?
You're even crueler now!

05:02.960 --> 05:04.560
You should have killed me.

05:04.640 --> 05:06.560
Back then, you should have killed me!

05:06.640 --> 05:07.680
But what did you do?

05:08.680 --> 05:11.200
You made me suffer so much
that I'd rather die.

05:12.760 --> 05:14.120
I couldn't bear to see you suffer.

05:15.080 --> 05:17.960
That's why I chose for you to kill me.

05:18.040 --> 05:20.400
Have you considered my feelings?

05:33.280 --> 05:35.720
I don't have time to listen

05:35.800 --> 05:38.040
to a dying soul now.

05:44.120 --> 05:45.160
Wait.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.360
Former Moon Supreme,

05:46.440 --> 05:48.720
what do you mean by letting him kill you?

05:48.800 --> 05:50.240
I read the secret book.

05:50.320 --> 05:52.760
It didn't state
that only by killing your loved one

05:52.840 --> 05:54.840
can you completely destroy
the seven emotions.

05:55.640 --> 05:57.000
That's because

05:57.800 --> 05:59.480
emotions are hard to destroy.

06:00.600 --> 06:02.640
Every time they come back to life,

06:03.320 --> 06:06.640
it takes a thousand years
to remove them completely again.

06:07.720 --> 06:09.360
Besides the secret technique…

06:13.600 --> 06:16.120
If you can kill your loved one,

06:18.040 --> 06:19.800
your emotions can be completely destroyed

06:20.400 --> 06:22.280
in an instant.

06:28.800 --> 06:29.760
So,

06:31.600 --> 06:32.840
you chose

06:33.880 --> 06:35.000
to let him

06:36.880 --> 06:37.960
kill you.

06:41.760 --> 06:44.960
It's worth sacrificing my life.

06:48.640 --> 06:49.560
Qingcang.

06:50.640 --> 06:53.200
Your emotional root has recovered.

06:55.080 --> 06:58.680
That's why you're in so much pain.

07:00.880 --> 07:01.840
Let me ask you.

07:02.440 --> 07:06.280
Are you going to be
the invincible Moon Supreme

07:06.360 --> 07:09.440
and bring the Moon Tribe back to glory?

07:10.480 --> 07:11.400
Or

07:12.520 --> 07:15.680
do you want
all of your previous sufferings

07:16.360 --> 07:17.400
to be in vain?

07:19.480 --> 07:22.600
If you continue to indulge
in your emotions and love,

07:22.680 --> 07:25.320
you will be in pain.

07:25.400 --> 07:26.880
You can't escape from it.

07:28.040 --> 07:29.040
Qingcang.

07:30.040 --> 07:31.640
Pull out your Hellfire sword

07:32.600 --> 07:34.280
and shatter my soul!

07:34.360 --> 07:39.480
Then you can get rid
of your emotional root.

07:40.800 --> 07:41.680
Hurry up!

07:58.280 --> 07:59.320
I can't do it.

08:01.320 --> 08:02.600
You can do it.

08:03.520 --> 08:04.840
Qingcang, have you forgotten?

08:05.760 --> 08:08.000
You did it once before.

08:08.760 --> 08:09.960
You can do it again.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.160
My boy.

08:14.280 --> 08:16.080
If you don't get rid
of your emotional root,

08:17.000 --> 08:21.240
you will be trapped in pain forever.

08:21.320 --> 08:22.600
Do you understand?

08:24.160 --> 08:26.840
Are you willing to bear the pain

08:26.920 --> 08:29.080
of killing your own father?

08:31.480 --> 08:32.360
Come!

08:40.760 --> 08:41.799
Recently,

08:43.480 --> 08:45.240
I kept thinking during the day

08:46.400 --> 08:47.680
and dreaming at night.

08:49.400 --> 08:51.080
They were the happy moments of us

08:52.160 --> 08:54.400
practicing sword fighting
and playing Cuju.

08:56.520 --> 08:58.480
So this time,
I have to make my own decision.

09:00.520 --> 09:03.400
I'd rather bear the pain
of killing my own father

09:04.480 --> 09:06.880
and bear the pain
caused by emotions and love.

09:08.720 --> 09:10.520
I don't want to forget these feelings.

09:30.440 --> 09:31.400
Come.

10:16.040 --> 10:17.040
Qingcang.

12:23.400 --> 12:24.520
Big Blockhead,

12:24.600 --> 12:25.720
what are you thinking?

12:25.800 --> 12:26.720
Kick it.

12:41.760 --> 12:42.720
Big Blockhead,

12:42.800 --> 12:45.520
if you miss this chance,
you won't have another one.

12:45.600 --> 12:47.000
Kick it.

13:04.280 --> 13:05.240
Father.

13:53.920 --> 13:55.320
How many lightning strikes are left?

13:59.640 --> 14:02.040
My lord, 30 bolts of lightning
were struck just now

14:02.120 --> 14:03.800
for the punishment
of 81 lightning strikes.

14:03.880 --> 14:05.440
There are 51 strikes left.

14:11.320 --> 14:12.320
I'll take

14:12.960 --> 14:14.080
the rest for him.

14:14.800 --> 14:16.040
- My lord.
- My lord, this…

14:16.120 --> 14:18.320
My lord, your body is precious.

14:18.400 --> 14:20.080
How can you take the punishment?

14:46.240 --> 14:47.400
Dongfang Qingcang.

14:48.920 --> 14:50.440
What tricks are you playing?

14:57.400 --> 14:58.440
Execute it.

15:11.320 --> 15:13.080
Do you want me to say it again?

15:13.960 --> 15:14.840
Execute it.

16:20.320 --> 16:22.440
The punishment of 81 lightning strikes
is completed.

16:24.040 --> 16:25.360
- Dongfang Qingcang!
- My lord!

16:27.040 --> 16:28.560
Big Blockhead, are you all right?

16:30.800 --> 16:31.720
Dongfang Qingcang.

16:34.440 --> 16:37.080
Don't think I'll thank you
for your pretentious act.

16:39.240 --> 16:40.960
Even in death,

16:42.120 --> 16:43.720
I will get my revenge for Father.

16:44.680 --> 16:45.800
Lord Xunfeng.

16:46.560 --> 16:47.800
As his brother,

16:48.520 --> 16:50.280
do you really know his pain?

16:50.960 --> 16:52.960
Do you know the truth between them?

16:54.000 --> 16:55.400
You only care about yourself.

16:56.200 --> 16:57.560
You know nothing.

17:05.359 --> 17:06.359
See for yourself.

17:27.079 --> 17:28.160
It has been so long.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.360
Why is he not up yet?

17:34.480 --> 17:35.880
Lightning strikes are strong.

17:35.960 --> 17:38.080
Even the lord can't take it.

17:38.160 --> 17:40.640
Although his life is not in danger,

17:41.200 --> 17:43.640
it will take some time
for him to recuperate.

18:09.800 --> 18:11.000
You're awake.

18:16.240 --> 18:17.240
Where are you going?

18:18.520 --> 18:19.640
I'm not going anywhere.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.520
Your medicine is almost ready.

18:21.600 --> 18:23.040
I need to keep an eye on the fire.

18:37.520 --> 18:38.600
The medicine…

18:47.440 --> 18:48.480
Moon Supreme?

18:49.520 --> 18:50.600
Moon Supreme?

19:36.080 --> 19:36.920
Are you

19:37.480 --> 19:40.680
willing to bear the pain
of killing your own father?

19:41.840 --> 19:43.120
Recently,

19:45.000 --> 19:46.520
I kept thinking during the day

19:47.840 --> 19:48.960
and dreaming at night.

19:50.680 --> 19:52.520
They were the happy moments of us

19:53.480 --> 19:55.400
practicing sword fighting
and playing Cuju.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.640
So this time,
I have to make my own decision.

20:01.440 --> 20:04.000
I'd rather bear the pain
of killing my own father

20:04.800 --> 20:07.480
and bear the pain
caused by emotions and love.

20:09.600 --> 20:11.320
I don't want to forget these feelings.

21:19.960 --> 21:22.120
In the past,
when it was my father's death anniversary,

21:23.920 --> 21:25.800
I didn't feel anything.

21:27.760 --> 21:28.720
Now,

21:30.080 --> 21:33.240
when I think that today
is his death anniversary…

21:34.320 --> 21:35.480
When I think that…

21:39.520 --> 21:41.760
I'll never see him again…

21:52.040 --> 21:53.960
If I destroy the Seven Emotions Tree,

21:55.040 --> 21:57.280
would the suffering end?

22:03.800 --> 22:05.800
Would the suffering end?

22:08.280 --> 22:09.520
I don't blame him.

22:11.360 --> 22:13.040
I don't blame him anymore.

22:53.240 --> 22:54.640
Time to take your medicine.

22:59.360 --> 23:01.040
Why do I have to take medicine again?

23:01.120 --> 23:03.000
It's bitter. How can I take it?

23:05.600 --> 23:07.400
How can you recover
without taking medicine?

23:14.760 --> 23:17.160
Because you didn't want to take medicine,

23:17.240 --> 23:19.160
you haven't recovered for days.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.920
The wounds are getting more painful.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.960
I have to hold you for you to walk.

23:28.880 --> 23:29.840
Take it in one go.

23:29.920 --> 23:31.720
You won't taste the bitterness.

23:39.120 --> 23:40.800
If you take it,

23:40.880 --> 23:43.560
I can make
your favorite flower cakes for you.

23:43.640 --> 23:45.920
Assorted flavors with honey.

24:05.520 --> 24:07.560
What do you mean by letting him kill you?

24:07.640 --> 24:09.080
I read the secret book.

24:09.160 --> 24:11.400
It didn't state
that only by killing your loved one

24:11.480 --> 24:13.640
can you completely destroy
the seven emotions.

24:14.400 --> 24:16.440
If you can kill your loved one,

24:18.560 --> 24:20.560
your emotions can be completely destroyed

24:20.640 --> 24:22.520
in an instant.

24:30.600 --> 24:33.320
Once you're done, get up and walk more.

24:33.400 --> 24:34.400
The doctor said

24:34.480 --> 24:36.960
you have to be able to walk freely

24:37.040 --> 24:38.600
for your wounds to be considered better.

24:42.680 --> 24:43.560
No.

24:44.080 --> 24:45.200
It still hurts.

24:45.920 --> 24:47.160
I need your help.

24:59.680 --> 25:00.600
My lord,

25:01.160 --> 25:02.440
Lord Xunfeng wants to see you.

25:05.320 --> 25:06.280
What is he doing here?

25:09.280 --> 25:10.160
Forget it.

25:10.840 --> 25:11.760
Let him in.

26:29.400 --> 26:30.320
Qingcang.

26:31.280 --> 26:32.360
How is your injury?

26:32.920 --> 26:34.680
It's just the punishment
of lightning strikes.

26:34.760 --> 26:36.240
I'm fine after some sleep.

26:37.560 --> 26:38.520
What about you?

26:39.920 --> 26:41.480
What brings you here?

26:42.800 --> 26:43.640
It's…

26:44.760 --> 26:46.800
to tell you the truth about Haishi.

26:48.960 --> 26:50.320
30,000 years ago,

26:50.880 --> 26:53.680
the news of you being killed
by the Fairy Realm spread to Cangyan Sea.

26:54.480 --> 26:56.160
The Kings of North and South You
had a mutiny.

26:56.800 --> 26:58.200
They intended to take over Ninth You.

26:59.880 --> 27:01.840
When I was extremely anxious,

27:03.280 --> 27:05.000
a mysterious man came to me.

27:06.640 --> 27:07.960
The Lord of Haishi?

27:08.760 --> 27:10.040
I didn't know who he was

27:10.840 --> 27:12.000
and where he came from.

27:13.360 --> 27:14.600
But he told me,

27:15.480 --> 27:17.760
as long as I can help him build Haishi,

27:18.720 --> 27:21.040
he can help me control
the Kings of North and South You.

27:22.160 --> 27:24.600
He never takes off his mask
and shows his real face.

27:27.400 --> 27:29.320
So at first, I didn't trust him.

27:31.320 --> 27:32.160
But…

27:32.840 --> 27:34.560
But both kings were pressing.

27:35.360 --> 27:37.040
So you accepted any help
that came your way.

27:37.120 --> 27:39.200
You even put the fate of Ninth You

27:39.280 --> 27:40.680
in the hands of an unknown person.

27:49.960 --> 27:50.840
Go on.

27:52.000 --> 27:54.040
Did you see his face after that?

27:55.800 --> 27:56.680
No.

27:58.200 --> 27:59.520
Not asking for his identity

28:00.600 --> 28:02.280
was one of his conditions for helping me.

28:03.080 --> 28:04.360
30,000 years ago,

28:05.080 --> 28:06.880
right at that point.

28:08.080 --> 28:09.560
Was the Lord of Haishi

28:09.640 --> 28:11.640
also involved in the Great War?

28:13.800 --> 28:15.320
Since you told me previously

28:16.080 --> 28:19.320
he used the primordial spirit of the dead
of the Moon Tribe to make evil qi,

28:20.040 --> 28:22.480
I recalled what happened
in the past 30,000 years carefully

28:22.560 --> 28:24.080
and noticed something.

28:26.080 --> 28:27.760
Whenever I was close to losing the war,

28:28.520 --> 28:30.520
he always helped me to turn the tide.

28:30.600 --> 28:32.320
Every time I had the upper hand,

28:32.400 --> 28:35.120
North and South You
always got away safely.

28:36.000 --> 28:37.880
The Lord of Haishi's planning

28:39.680 --> 28:40.880
is like…

28:43.880 --> 28:46.680
Always letting you fight
against each other

28:47.400 --> 28:49.520
without getting a definite result.

28:51.960 --> 28:53.720
The three kings of Cangyan Sea

28:55.760 --> 28:56.920
engaged in civil unrest

28:57.760 --> 28:59.480
that lasted
for tens of thousands of years,

29:00.360 --> 29:02.160
causing the power
of the Moon Tribe to perish.

29:04.000 --> 29:05.440
I'm so stupid.

29:07.280 --> 29:08.880
I feel guilty towards my people.

29:10.120 --> 29:11.320
I deserve to die.

29:13.040 --> 29:15.640
You shouldn't have pardoned me
the day before yesterday.

29:15.720 --> 29:17.760
I didn't pardon you.

29:28.040 --> 29:29.520
From now on,

29:30.480 --> 29:32.760
you have to win on the battlefield

29:33.400 --> 29:34.560
to correct your mistake.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.600
Yes.

29:47.080 --> 29:48.240
You may leave.

29:52.800 --> 29:53.760
What?

29:54.680 --> 29:57.200
Are there any details missing?

29:58.920 --> 29:59.760
No.

29:59.840 --> 30:02.160
In that case, you may leave now.

30:08.320 --> 30:09.240
Yes.

30:10.000 --> 30:10.840
Big Blockhead,

30:11.560 --> 30:14.320
are you still holding a grudge
against Lord Xunfeng

30:14.400 --> 30:15.560
for wanting to kill you?

30:15.640 --> 30:17.600
There are countless people
in the three realms

30:17.680 --> 30:19.120
who want to kill me.

30:19.200 --> 30:20.840
He's not even on the list.

30:21.440 --> 30:22.440
It's a trivial matter.

30:22.520 --> 30:23.880
Since he has admitted his mistake,

30:23.960 --> 30:25.720
I don't blame him.

30:27.960 --> 30:29.160
Why do you ask?

30:29.720 --> 30:30.640
Just now,

30:30.720 --> 30:33.120
didn't you see his desire to speak?

30:33.680 --> 30:35.280
He wanted to tell you something,

30:35.360 --> 30:38.200
but he's afraid to bring up the past
and upset you.

30:41.080 --> 30:42.240
Did he really misunderstand?

30:44.640 --> 30:46.840
You finally made up after so long.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.240
I think

30:49.320 --> 30:51.160
next time you see him,

30:51.240 --> 30:54.000
don't always act like
the almighty Moon Supreme

30:54.080 --> 30:55.440
and scold him.

30:55.520 --> 30:57.760
If it was me, I would be scared too.

30:58.400 --> 31:00.320
You need to do something intimate.

31:00.400 --> 31:01.960
This way, he will know

31:02.040 --> 31:04.040
that you've forgiven him.

31:05.040 --> 31:06.480
Something intimate?

31:07.760 --> 31:10.480
You don't want to?

31:16.800 --> 31:19.080
I don't know how.

31:22.560 --> 31:25.000
People only taught me
how to become stronger,

31:25.080 --> 31:26.360
how to kill,

31:26.440 --> 31:27.840
and how to conquer the world.

31:27.920 --> 31:29.920
But no one has ever taught me

31:31.120 --> 31:32.680
how to get close to others.

31:36.080 --> 31:37.360
This is very simple.

31:37.440 --> 31:38.400
Let me teach you.

31:39.200 --> 31:40.960
Next time you see him,

31:41.040 --> 31:42.280
don't pull a long face.

31:42.360 --> 31:43.320
You need to smile.

31:43.400 --> 31:44.920
Come on, smile for me.

31:55.920 --> 31:58.600
Can you smile more naturally?

32:25.480 --> 32:26.360
Look.

32:26.440 --> 32:28.760
This is a good angle.

32:41.600 --> 32:43.880
Is this enough?

32:43.960 --> 32:45.000
No.

32:46.280 --> 32:47.760
You are brothers.

32:47.840 --> 32:49.320
Next time you see him,

32:49.400 --> 32:50.800
you need to be more friendly.

32:51.880 --> 32:52.840
How?

32:55.640 --> 32:56.800
Let me think.

32:59.200 --> 33:00.240
I got it.

33:00.320 --> 33:02.280
Next time you see him, you can hug him.

33:02.840 --> 33:03.720
How?

33:04.320 --> 33:05.280
Like this…

33:11.920 --> 33:13.000
Just…

33:13.080 --> 33:14.680
Hug him like this

33:14.760 --> 33:17.960
or pat his shoulder.

33:21.720 --> 33:23.240
Next time you see him,

33:23.320 --> 33:24.640
you'll do it, right?

33:25.840 --> 33:26.880
No.

33:26.960 --> 33:27.920
Why?

33:28.480 --> 33:29.320
It's cheesy.

33:29.400 --> 33:30.720
How is this cheesy?

33:32.480 --> 33:33.680
How is this cheesy?

33:55.040 --> 33:56.080
Hey!

33:56.800 --> 33:59.440
What are you thinking about
that you're smiling so happily?

34:00.960 --> 34:02.200
Jieli.

34:02.280 --> 34:03.960
Have you ever noticed

34:04.040 --> 34:05.200
that sometimes

34:05.280 --> 34:07.040
the Moon Supreme is quite cute?

34:07.600 --> 34:08.480
Cute?

34:09.280 --> 34:10.440
Are you all right?

34:10.520 --> 34:12.360
How can the Moon Supreme be cute?

34:13.199 --> 34:14.360
You didn't see it.

34:14.440 --> 34:16.520
When he was learning
how to smile at people,

34:16.600 --> 34:18.040
he was silly and cute.

34:18.120 --> 34:19.800
He'll do whatever you tell him to do.

34:19.880 --> 34:20.960
He is very serious.

34:22.400 --> 34:24.520
Orchid…

34:24.600 --> 34:26.159
You're really something.

34:29.639 --> 34:31.320
I thought I was a good liar.

34:31.920 --> 34:34.280
You don't usually show it,

34:34.920 --> 34:38.440
but I didn't expect you
to be so good at acting.

34:39.000 --> 34:40.080
First, you risked your life

34:40.159 --> 34:42.080
to find the former Moon Supreme's
primordial spirit.

34:42.800 --> 34:45.320
Then, you boiled medicine
and made pastries for him daily.

34:45.400 --> 34:46.520
Whenever you talk about him,

34:46.600 --> 34:49.239
you smile and glow.

34:49.800 --> 34:52.120
If I hadn't known you were acting,

34:52.199 --> 34:53.920
I would have been like the Moon Supreme

34:54.000 --> 34:56.440
and think
you've betrayed Shuiyuntian for him.

35:09.120 --> 35:10.560
Are you

35:11.360 --> 35:12.640
not acting?

35:13.400 --> 35:14.440
You mean it?

35:15.520 --> 35:16.480
No way.

35:17.160 --> 35:18.800
Of course I was acting.

35:19.920 --> 35:21.000
Good acting, right?

35:52.200 --> 35:53.160
My lord,

35:53.720 --> 35:54.920
Lord Xunfeng wants to see you.

36:04.320 --> 36:06.640
Is what you said true?

36:07.720 --> 36:09.280
The seal that holds 100,000 soldiers

36:09.360 --> 36:10.600
at Xuanxu Realm for 30,000 years

36:10.680 --> 36:11.520
can be broken?

36:11.600 --> 36:14.880
Yes. The next reincarnation of Lady Chidi
who'll be experiencing hardships

36:14.960 --> 36:16.120
is called Xie Wanqing.

36:16.200 --> 36:17.920
When she is born,

36:18.000 --> 36:20.120
I want you to go
to Yunmeng Lake immediately

36:20.200 --> 36:21.840
and take her to Xuanxu Realm.

36:21.920 --> 36:24.000
Place her primordial spirit
into Shuofeng Sword.

36:24.080 --> 36:25.720
It can break the seal

36:25.800 --> 36:27.360
and you can bring back 100,000 soldiers.

36:29.160 --> 36:30.240
I'll set out immediately.

36:34.320 --> 36:35.280
Wait!

36:39.200 --> 36:40.560
What else can I do for you?

37:13.240 --> 37:15.120
You're still injured.

37:15.800 --> 37:16.800
You must be careful.

37:25.240 --> 37:26.280
Yes.

38:03.240 --> 38:04.320
So he didn't hug him.

38:05.520 --> 38:07.320
He was shy.

38:07.400 --> 38:08.880
For him,

38:08.960 --> 38:10.800
it's a massive improvement.

38:11.520 --> 38:12.560
Shangque.

38:12.640 --> 38:15.040
Your lord has feelings now.

38:15.600 --> 38:19.160
He knows forgiveness, kindness, and mercy.

38:19.240 --> 38:20.920
That's great.

38:33.040 --> 38:34.200
What's wrong with you two?

38:34.280 --> 38:35.120
Are you unhappy?

38:35.800 --> 38:36.720
Not really.

38:37.560 --> 38:39.360
He and Lord Xunfeng have made up.

38:39.440 --> 38:41.480
They are working together,
of course I'm happy.

38:41.560 --> 38:42.480
But…

38:43.400 --> 38:45.520
If the lord has really changed
as you said,

38:46.480 --> 38:47.720
is he still the Moon Supreme?

38:48.360 --> 38:49.560
Why not?

38:49.640 --> 38:52.600
Since ancient times, the Fairies
and the Moon Tribe have been enemies.

38:53.240 --> 38:55.280
Our first ancestor
once passed an ancestral teaching.

38:55.360 --> 38:58.000
Only a tough general
who never gives up on hatred

38:58.080 --> 38:59.920
is the key to the survival
of the Moon Tribe.

39:00.600 --> 39:02.320
Why must there be hatred?

39:02.840 --> 39:05.120
Whether it's the Moon Tribe
or the Fairies,

39:05.200 --> 39:06.520
there are good people.

39:08.640 --> 39:10.080
Let's not talk about Shuiyuntian.

39:10.640 --> 39:13.000
Anyway, the lord will destroy
the Fairy Realm

39:13.080 --> 39:14.320
to avenge the Moon Tribe.

39:14.400 --> 39:16.280
I believe he won't give up.

39:16.840 --> 39:20.040
That's because you didn't see how he was
with the former Moon Supreme.

39:20.840 --> 39:22.600
He's different now.

39:23.120 --> 39:24.880
He's no longer
the Dongfang Qingcang we know.

39:33.160 --> 39:35.400
Jieli, what's with that look?

39:39.800 --> 39:40.720
My lord.

39:41.480 --> 39:42.400
My lord.

40:06.640 --> 40:09.520
Are my fresh flower cakes ready?

40:10.320 --> 40:11.760
Have you taken your medicine?

40:13.240 --> 40:14.640
The medicine is too bitter.

40:17.280 --> 40:18.960
But I've finished it.

40:19.040 --> 40:20.320
There's not a drop left.

40:22.880 --> 40:25.120
The fresh flower cakes are almost ready.
I'll get them.

40:25.200 --> 40:26.240
Wait.

40:30.240 --> 40:31.240
What is this?

40:32.000 --> 40:33.400
According to the Moon Tribe's rules,

40:34.360 --> 40:35.600
if you want to thank someone,

40:35.680 --> 40:36.880
you must use your blood

40:37.600 --> 40:39.000
and apply it to that person's face.

40:41.960 --> 40:44.520
Thank you very much.

40:46.200 --> 40:48.640
No, this is your blood.

40:51.640 --> 40:53.760
I guessed you might not like blood,

40:54.400 --> 40:56.040
so I changed it to cinnabar.

40:57.800 --> 40:59.360
Can I not apply it?

41:00.400 --> 41:01.240
No.

41:01.920 --> 41:04.000
This is the first time
I've ever thanked a person.

41:04.800 --> 41:06.160
Don't refuse me.
